      <div class="msv__section-hd">
        <h2>Common Mistakes That Cause Rejection</h2>
        <p>Learn what goes wrong—and how to avoid it. Most rejections are preventable with proper preparation.</p>
      </div>

      <div style="display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(300px, 1fr)); gap: 1.5rem; margin-top: 2rem;">
        <div style="background: #fef2f2; border: 1px solid #fca5a5; border-radius: 10px; padding: 1.5rem;">
          <h4 style="color: var(--red); font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 0.5rem;">1. Missing the Deadline</h4>
          <p style="font-size: 0.9rem; color: var(--black); margin: 0; line-height: 1.6;">Applying after the 60-days-before to 90-days-after window closes results in automatic rejection and potential loss of status. This is the #1 reason for denials.</p>
        </div>

        <div style="background: #fef2f2; border: 1px solid #fca5a5; border-radius: 10px; padding: 1.5rem;">
          <h4 style="color: var(--red); font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 0.5rem;">2. Insufficient Funds / Income Documentation</h4>
          <p style="font-size: 0.9rem; color: var(--black); margin: 0; line-height: 1.6;">NLV holders especially: failing to prove the minimum monthly income (typically €2,300+) gets you rejected. Bank statements must show consistent deposits over several months.</p>
        </div>

        <div style="background: #fef2f2; border: 1px solid #fca5a5; border-radius: 10px; padding: 1.5rem;">
          <h4 style="color: var(--red); font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 0.5rem;">3. Gaps in Health Insurance</h4>
          <p style="font-size: 0.9rem; color: var(--black); margin: 0; line-height: 1.6;">Your health insurance must be continuous and valid through the entire renewal period. A one-day gap results in rejection. Never let your policy lapse.</p>
        </div>

        <div style="background: #fef2f2; border: 1px solid #fca5a5; border-radius: 10px; padding: 1.5rem;">
          <h4 style="color: var(--red); font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 0.5rem;">4. Violating Original Permit Conditions</h4>
          <p style="font-size: 0.9rem; color: var(--black); margin: 0; line-height: 1.6;">NLV holders who worked in Spain, or DNV holders who lost remote work status: admission of condition violations means automatic denial. Speak with a lawyer before renewal if uncertain.</p>
        </div>

        <div style="background: #fef2f2; border: 1px solid #fca5a5; border-radius: 10px; padding: 1.5rem;">
          <h4 style="color: var(--red); font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 0.5rem;">5. Incomplete or Incorrectly Filled Documents</h4>
          <p style="font-size: 0.9rem; color: var(--black); margin: 0; line-height: 1.6;">Missing signature, wrong name spelling, undated forms: small errors force you to reschedule. Review every document twice before submission.</p>
        </div>

        <div style="background: #fef2f2; border: 1px solid #fca5a5; border-radius: 10px; padding: 1.5rem;">
          <h4 style="color: var(--red); font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 0.5rem;">6. Not Registered on Padrón</h4>
          <p style="font-size: 0.9rem; color: var(--black); margin: 0; line-height: 1.6;">Empadronamiento is mandatory. If you're not registered with your local municipality or your address is outdated, your application will be rejected. Update your padrón registration immediately.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
